        <body>A RequirementCollectionRelationship is a type of RequirementViewRelationship. It identifies a collection relationship that is used to relate a parent (collection) requirement to its member requirements. This provides a method for collecting together a set of requirements and treating them as a single requirement, whilst still being able to refer to individual requirements.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>RequirementCollectionRelationship</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194020_780421_28755" xmi:uuid="56a79d3c-8c1b-4120-963a-efface0a7a75" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193235_212010_23827"/>
      </generalization>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193549_22592_25890" xmi:uuid="eaa09d3d-9671-4e08-9edf-588b1d51dac1" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
