        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1513262749843_113965_62495"/>
        <body>An Evidence is a collector of items used together to provide a single piece of evidence within a validation or verification. &lt;example&gt;A document and its approval by a customer may be used together to provide evidence of customer acceptance.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>Evidence</name>
