          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1547138339522_639019_109875"/>
          <body>the inherited attribute RelationType. The value of RelationType shall be 'tracing'. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
        </ownedComment>
