    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193225_975113_23814" xmi:uuid="e3f31a32-0edb-4ee6-8eda-ae403fd498de" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455704690800_960533_42616" xmi:uuid="39a2a561-9196-447f-aca2-3202391f425e" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193225_975113_23814"/>
        <body>A RequirementAssignment is used to relate a Requirement (via a RequirementView) to data types representing the items (specified in RequirementAssignmentSelect) which are affected by the requirement. &lt;example&gt;A requirement "the vehicle shall have a maximum power output of at least 150BHP" could be assigned to the data types which are used to represent the vehicle's engine.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>RequirementAssignment</name>
